{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1112100-lost-errata","id":1112100,"title":"Lost Errata","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-06T07:42:20-07:00","id":1112100,"title":"Lost Errata","content":"So I'm wondering if anyone has a copy of the Errata that used to be on the White Wolf Forums before they went down. I used to have it saved through the White Wolf Forum archive before that went down. Then I used to have it through the Shadownessence but that went down.<br /> While this may not seem like huge deal for most of the lines, Mummy the Resurrection has lost pretty much all of its Errata, and that game had a huge number of problems in the core books as they changed one of the mechanics a week before printing and didn't fix the entire book. I imagine the other lines may have a similar issue to a degree.<br /> I'd post the link to the White Wolf Archive, but the site was turned into a virus effected Wyrm den.<br /> <br /> So now I'm here kicking myself for not saving it, the White Wolf archivist disappeared a year ago, and Shadownessence is gone. So I'm hoping someone has them so they can be put in a more public place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key